  "description": "The BULLS Iconic EVO 1 750 Wave is your go-to eSUV for seamless city cruising and weekend trail exploring. With its wave frame design, powerful Bosch motor, and full-utility spec, this eBike blends comfort, performance, and versatility into one reliable ride.\n\nMotor and Battery\n\nMotor: Bosch Performance Line CX with 85 Nm of torque, Class-1 pedal-assist (up to 20 mph). Powerful and smooth, ideal for climbs, commutes, and everything in between.\n\nBattery: Bosch PowerTube 750 Wh, fully integrated into the downtube. Provides extended range and recharges fully in approximately 6 hours.\n\nSuspension and Frame\n\nFork: SR Suntour XCM32-DS LOR Coil with 120mm of travel. A solid front suspension setup for mixed-terrain comfort and control.\n\nFrame: 6061 aluminum with internal cable routing. Lightweight and tough, available in sizes 41/44/48/54 cm to fit a variety of riders.\n\nDrivetrain and Brakes\n\nDrivetrain: Shimano Deore 10-speed for smooth, precise shifting and plenty of range for climbing or cruising.\n\nBrakes: Tektro HD-M390 hydraulic disc brakes (180mm front and rear) for dependable stopping power in all conditions.\n\nWheels and Tires\n\nWheels: 27.5\" alloy wheels strike the perfect balance between quick maneuverability and stable handling.\n\nTires: Supero All Ground 2.4\" wide tires grip confidently on pavement, gravel, or light trails.\n\nAdditional Features\n\nDisplay: The Bosch LED Remote and Kiox 300 combo delivers sleek, intuitive control and real-time ride data, turning your eBike into a smart, connected adventure machine.\n\nPedals: Wellgo C-098DU pedals for stability and secure footing.\n\nSaddle: Iconic SUV saddle, shaped for comfort over longer rides.\n\nTechnology and Design\n\nMonkeyLink Ready: Integrated mounts let you quickly add compatible lights and fenders—no tools needed.\n\nClass-1 eBike: Pedal-assist support up to 20 mph—perfect for bike paths, city streets, and park trails.\n\nIf you're looking for a comfortable step-through eSUV with real power under the hood, the Iconic EVO 1 750 Wave is it. Whether you're running errands or escaping to nature, it’s built to handle it all with ease and confidence.",
